{"slug":"ami-bera","qid":"Q3389105","name":"Ami Bera","desc":"American physician and politician","article":"Ami Bera","born":"1965-03-02","died":null,"birthplace":"Los Angeles","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"CA-06","f":2023,"u":null},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"CA-07","f":2013,"u":2023}],"summary":"Amerish Babulal \"Ami\" Bera ( AH-mee BERR-ə; born March 2, 1965) is an American physician and politician who has been serving as a member of the United States House of Representatives from California since 2013. He is a member of the Democratic Party and represents California's 6th congressional district, which is in Sacramento County.\nPrior to his time in Congress, Bera worked as a physician and served as the chief medical officer for Sacramento County.","photo":{"f":"ami-bera.jpg","by":"Ike Hayman, House Creative Services","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":null,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ami_Bera_117th_Congress.jpeg"},"history":[{"y":2026,"o":"H","k":"CA-03","p":"D","n":"Ami Bera","race":"CA-03"},{"y":2024,"o":"H","k":"CA-06","p":"D","v":165408,"s":57.62,"w":true,"n":"Ami Bera"},{"y":2022,"o":"H","k":"CA-06","p":"D","v":121058,"s":55.95,"w":true,"n":"Ami Bera"},{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"CA-07","p":"D","v":217416,"s":56.62,"w":true,"n":"Ami Bera"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"CA-07","p":"D","v":155016,"s":55.04,"w":true,"n":"Ami Bera"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"CA-07","p":"D","v":152133,"s":51.17,"w":true,"n":"Ami Bera"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"CA-07","p":"D","v":92521,"s":50.4,"w":true,"n":"Ami Bera"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"CA-07","p":"D","v":141241,"s":51.68,"w":true,"n":"Ami Bera"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"CA-03","p":"D","v":113128,"s":43.19,"w":false,"n":"Ami Bera"}]}